#text(size: 20pt, weight: "bold")[GPU query timeline follow-up]

RTX 4090 · fixed 63-bit query prefixes · 31 October 2026

Both Nsight Systems traces completed. Their service replies, and both separate
unprofiled replays, matched the saved v1 prefixes byte for byte. Each prefix
contains eight full-table misses and includes one-time table preparation.

